<title>HONG KONG: Dynamic 1995/96 net rises 8.13 percent.</title>
<headline>Dynamic 1995/96 net rises 8.13 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   43.7	 vs 40.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    8.0	  vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  53.90 gain vs 46.92 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    92.23	vs 85.30</p>
<p>    Turnover		     62.02	vs 63.59</p>
<p>    Company name		 Dynamic Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 20-30, 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 15, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Dynamic Holdings engages in property investment and development, warehousing and cargo handling.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain mainly on disposal of its 55 percent interests in subsidiaries engaged in investment holding and property investment.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 16 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of eight cents) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
